{"updated":"2026-10-02T07:09:25.763Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: US pressures Europe to release diesel reserves as Trump threatens export ban. Elsewhere, australia news live: Union leader says PM ‘vastly underpaid’; Shoebridge pledges members will ‘have a say’ in next leader. And miami judge rules federal noncitizen voting law violates US Constitution. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Ukraine are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, took it in stride — the S&P 500 up 0.5 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.5 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite up 3.0 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 34 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.3 near 0 km NNE of Yōkaichiba, Japan. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.23,0.28,0.34,0.37,0.41,0.45,0.5,0.53,0.56,0.6,0.63,0.67,0.8,0.89,1.07,1.35,1.46,1.51,1.53,1.56,1.6,1.63,1.65,1.67,1.72,1.75,1.83,1.89,1.94,1.97,2.01,2.06,2.09,2.13,2.18,2.23,2.28,2.31,2.36,2.4,2.45,2.51,2.55,2.61,2.67,2.74,2.86,2.95,3.06,3.09,3.13,3.16,3.22,3.26,3.32,3.44,3.52,3.58,3.65,3.69,3.75,3.79,3.83,3.88,3.9,3.92,3.98,4,4.03,4.05,4.11,4.14,4.26,4.32,4.4,4.49,4.56,4.68,4.71,4.77,4.79,4.85,4.97,5.12,5.33,5.71,5.86,6.04,6.11,6.15,6.2,6.25,6.29,6.33,6.38,6.42,6.44,6.49,6.56,6.64,6.71,6.77,6.83,6.87,6.99,7.07,7.15,7.19,7.26,7.3,7.36,7.41,7.44,7.49,7.54,7.58,7.64,7.69,7.75,7.8,7.87,7.94,7.98,8.06,8.1,8.17,8.24,8.37,8.44,8.49,8.53,8.59,8.77,8.88,8.93,9,9.04,9.1,9.15,9.21,9.27,9.34,9.36,9.4,9.44,9.47,9.51,9.57,9.63,9.68,9.75,9.83,9.95,10.03,10.11,10.19,10.25,10.3,10.36,10.4,10.58,10.71,10.88,11.48,11.6,11.66,11.71,11.76,11.81,11.87,11.9,11.96,12.07,12.11,12.16,12.24,12.28,12.32,12.38,12.44,12.5,12.57,12.63,12.69,12.78,12.85,12.95,13.04,13.1,13.18,13.24,13.41,13.47,13.62,13.66